      "impact": "The new helper contains non-trivial validation and subprocess behavior, but the PR adds no tests for valid execution, non-zero ping results, timeout handling, empty/dash-prefixed hosts, or count bounds. A later change could silently break operator reachability checks or their error handling without CI catching it.",
